From 226f89ecb5b6a490e91adb853a02f272ff3da420 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 10:29:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/24] vulkan: write the PQ2_0 mat-vec q8_1 activation from
 the fused FWHT kernels

MUL_FWHT and NORM_FWHT also store the quantize_q8_1_x4_i4 copy into prealloc_y (same arithmetic, same bytes) and
mark the cache when a PQ2_0 MMVQ mat-vec reads the rotation: one dispatch and one barrier less per rotated
activation (257 per Bonsai decode token). GGML_VK_DISABLE_FWHT_Q8 turns it off. Test: FWHT_MMVQ.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
